{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07344","headline":"禅智寺上方怀演和尚寺即和尚所创 · 刘长卿","name":"禅智寺上方怀演和尚寺即和尚所创","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝巘东林寺，高僧惠远公。\n买园隋苑下，持鉢楚城中。\n斗极千灯近，烟波万井通。\n远山低月殿，寒木露花宫。\n绀宇焚香净，沧州摆雾空。\n鴈来秋色里，曙起早潮东。\n飞锡今何在？苍生待发蒙。\n白云翻送客，庭树自辞风。\n舍筏追开士，回舟狎钓翁。\n平生江海意，惟共白鸥同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}